      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Recent integration of spatial localization equipment with imaging systems presents more precise methods for the delivery of deep body nerve blocks. This technology builds on the already accepted use of CT as a guide for many currently used nerve blocks by delivering improved control, precision, and visualization of needle placement. This paper discusses the improvements and possibilities this technology brings to the treatment of neuropathies."},
